// Generated by ⊙perator — implements U₀ through U₈₇.
// U₀–U₁₁: hand-crafted canonical + Phase I dialects (exact gate/tier strings preserved).
// U₁₂–U₈₇: Phase III expansion (59 dialects) — bridged to dialect_expansion.rs.
//
// U₈ (chirality_first), U₉ (scope_dialect), U₁₀ (triple_criticality) added
// 2026-06-16, ported from imscribing_grammar/scripts/new_dialects.py.
// u8_max raised: 11→87 on 2026-07-04 alongside the dialect_expansion bridge.
