2	//!
3	//! Stage one: a 256-bit Montgomery multiply (CIOS, four 64-bit limbs), the
4	//! primitive Pollard rho and ECM ride on. Verified here against BigUint before
5	//! anything is built on it: `gpu_rho verify` multiplies random pairs modulo
6	//! random odd 256-bit moduli on the GPU and checks each against the reference.
