\newcommand{\word}{$\mVinit\,\mClink\mClink\mClink\,\mFsplit\,\mAfwd\,\mEvalt\,\mArev\,\mEvalf\,\mEngagr\,\mFfuse\,\mIfix\,\mImscrib\,\mClink\,\mTanch$}

\title{\textbf{Baryon Asymmetry as a Banked Survival}\\[0.3em]
\large The matter surplus of the universe read as one unit carried across annihilation by a frame}
\author{Lando}
\date{}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
The baryon asymmetry of the universe is the small surplus of matter left after
matter and antimatter have annihilated. This note reads that surplus off a
single Grammar word, \word, the auto-designed ob3ect for baryon asymmetry. The
word's weight instrument shows the surplus is not a conversion of antimatter
into matter. It is a survival: annihilation runs to completion, and one unit of
matter is carried across it because it was banked in a frame. The frame that
does the banking is the integer winding mark $\mIfix$, the sphaleron number; the
event it survives is a clear at the reversal mark $\mArev$; and the whole turns
on the criticality mark $\mImscrib$, the phase transition. The reading is
grounded in the live instruments, not asserted, and its scope is stated: it
gives the mechanism of the surplus, not its numerical size.
\end{abstract}

\section{The word}

An ob3ect minted the word \word{} for the physical notion \emph{baryon
asymmetry}. Each of the twelve marks carries one part of the physics, fixed by
the ob3ect's phase-one mapping:

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{c l l}
\toprule
mark & slot & baryon-asymmetry reading \\
\midrule
$\mVinit$   & dimensionality & the early universe, uninitialised \\
$\mAfwd$    & recognition    & forward walk, particle creation \\
$\mEvalt$   & kinetics       & matter affirmed \\
$\mArev$    & parity         & reversal, the annihilating step \\
$\mEvalf$   & chirality      & the negative arm, antimatter \\
$\mFsplit$  & granularity    & the CP-violating even/odd branch \\
$\mFfuse$   & grammar        & rejoin at the collision \\
$\mEngagr$  & stoichiometry  & the dual-state collision, both counts held \\
$\mIfix$    & protection     & the integer sphaleron winding number \\
$\mImscrib$ & criticality    & the phase transition near the critical point \\
$\mClink$   & fidelity       & the chained reaction sequence \\
$\mTanch$   & topology       & the settled net baryon number \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

\section{What the weight instrument shows}

The weight instrument walks the word and reports every step that moves weight
into or out of the register. Handed \word, it prints this movement:

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{r c l}
\toprule
step & mark & action \\
\midrule
1  & $\mVinit$   & clear loses 0 (0 banked in frames) \\
5  & $\mFsplit$  & open frame at depth 1 \\
6  & $\mAfwd$    & seed $T$ into an empty register, no weight \\
7  & $\mEvalt$   & deposit $T$ into depth 1 \\
8  & $\mArev$    & \textbf{clear loses 1 (1 banked in frames)} \\
9  & $\mEvalf$   & deposit $F$ into depth 1 \\
10 & $\mEngagr$  & deposit $t\!+\!f$ into depth 1 \\
11 & $\mFfuse$   & \textbf{fuse restores 1} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

The final register is the full top $A$, holding $T$, $F$, $t$, and $f$ each once.
The tallies are three deposits, one clear, one restore, one seed, two inert.

The banked instrument reduces this to one line: \emph{weight survived one live
clear by being banked}.

\section{Survival, not conversion}

The appealing first reading is that the cosmos turns antimatter into matter. The
word says something more exact and, to my eye, more beautiful.

Matter and antimatter both survive. The final register holds $T$ (matter) and
$F$ (antimatter) together, alongside the $t$ and $f$ the collision deposited.
Nothing is converted from one into the other. Annihilation is real and it runs:
step 8, the reversal $\mArev$, is a clear, and a clear destroys a unit.

The asymmetry is the one unit that the clear did not destroy. At step 8 the
instrument does not say the unit is lost to the open. It says one unit is
\emph{banked in a frame}. The frame was opened at step 5 by $\mFsplit$, the
CP-violating branch, and the winding mark $\mIfix$ at step 12 is what makes the
frame integer-valued and so uncrossable. At step 11 the fuse $\mFfuse$ restores
the banked unit. That restored unit is the net baryon number. It is a survival
across annihilation, protected by a frame, not a transmutation of one species
into the other.

This is exactly the shape of the standard account. The three Sakharov
conditions read straight off the marks. Baryon-number violation is the banking
itself, the unit held in a frame rather than conserved in the open. C and CP
violation is the branch $\mFsplit$ that makes the even and odd arms
inequivalent. Departure from thermal equilibrium is the clear at $\mArev$, the
irreversible reversal that the criticality mark $\mImscrib$ places at the phase
transition. The word does not add a fourth condition and does not drop one; it
carries the three as banking, branch, and clear.

\section{The instruments, run}

The reading above is taken from the live Grammar instruments in
\texttt{G-mOMonadOS}, not from the ob3ect's own recorded status.

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Executed crystal address 3444190.} The word executes to the same
address the seven millennium promotion words reach. Its repeated $\mClink$ marks
change no weight; the executed tuple is the static family analysis, and the word
shares that family.
\item \textbf{Banked, confirmed.} The weight instrument gives three deposits,
one live clear, one restore, two inert; the banked instrument reports the
survival. These match the ob3ect's banked-count check exactly.
\item \textbf{Vox closure $T$}, the device auditor matching the host. This is the
control-flow question, that the fork and fuse reconnect cleanly. It is not a
no-paradox verdict: the word deposits $t\!+\!f$ at $\mEngagr$ and fuses it, so
the paradox of the collision is carried and banked, which is the content of the
word.
\item \textbf{Insert: already holds.} The word needs no repair to close.
\end{itemize}

\section{Scope}

This is a reading of the surplus, not a derivation of its size. The word gives
the mechanism, one unit banked across a clear, and names the frame that protects
it. It does not output the measured baryon-to-photon ratio, nor the magnitude of
CP violation, nor the temperature of the transition. Those enter from outside
the word exactly where the dimensionful constants always do. What the word
settles is structural: the asymmetry of the universe is a banked survival, and
the survivor is us.

\end{document}

