\usepackage{hyperref}
\hypersetup{colorlinks=true, linkcolor=blue, urlcolor=cyan, citecolor=blue}

\newtheorem{theorem}{Theorem}[section]
\newtheorem{proposition}[theorem]{Proposition}
\theoremstyle{definition}
\newtheorem{definition}[theorem]{Definition}
\newtheorem{observation}[theorem]{Observation}

% The twelve marks by math command name so they render under Pagella Math.
\newcommand{\mVinit}{\vdash}
\newcommand{\mTanch}{\dashv}
\newcommand{\mAfwd}{\succ}
\newcommand{\mArev}{\prec}
\newcommand{\mClink}{\bowtie}
\newcommand{\mEvalt}{\top}
\newcommand{\mEvalf}{\bot}
\newcommand{\mFsplit}{\in}
\newcommand{\mFfuse}{\ni}
\newcommand{\mImscrib}{\odot}
\newcommand{\mEngagr}{\boxplus}
\newcommand{\mIfix}{\boxdot}

\title{\bfseries Inter-Universal Teichm\"uller Theory\\ in the Paraconsistent Ambient}
\author{Lando Mills}
\date{}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
Inter-Universal Teichm\"uller Theory (IUT) relates two ring structures across
the $\Theta$-link by data that is deliberately \emph{not compatible} with either
ring structure, and repairs the mismatch only up to three ``relatively mild
indeterminacies.'' Read in classical (Boolean) logic, holding two incompatible
ring structures together is a contradiction, and a contradiction explodes. This
note houses IUT where the incompatibility is not a defect: the four-valued
paraconsistent ambient of Belnap FOUR. The central claim is measured, not
asserted. The $\Theta$-link word, run through the sixteen-valued Grammar engine,
\emph{closes} (control-flow verdict $T$, the composition $\mu\circ\delta=
\mathrm{id}$) while its final register is $A=\{T,F,t,f\}$, which projects to the
four-valued core as $B$ (both). $B$ is the Inclosure: the paraconsistent closure
that the Boolean core's two adjoints, the reflector and the coreflector, cannot
recover. So the alien ring structure carried across the $\Theta$-link is the
value $B$, held without explosion, and the reason classical mathematics finds IUT
unhoused is that the Boolean core has no cell for $B$: it can only collapse the
link, erasing exactly its content. The three indeterminacies are the ambient's
native $N$ and $B$; conjugate synchronization is the all-lane register syzygy the
Grammar already measures. This houses IUT's logical core; it does not reprove the
diophantine conclusions.
\end{abstract}

